@startuml
title Verifier Proof Request

participant Verifier
participant "WalletConnect" as WC
participant Wallet
participant "Status Registry" as SR

Verifier -> WC: Generate request QR (VC type, nonce, fee)
Wallet -> WC: Scan QR, establish session
Wallet -> Holder: Prompt consent + biometrics
Wallet -> Verifier: Send proof-of-possession
Verifier -> SR: Pay fee + query VC status (Merkle proof)
SR -> Verifier: Proof result (valid/revoked)
Verifier -> User: Display outcome

@enduml
